---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import imgHero from '../../assets/products/01-kit-bioaqua-vitamina-c.jpg';
---
<section class="modelo-hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
        <Image src={imgHero} alt="DistriSam" class="hero-img" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-content" data-reveal="blur-up">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Florece desde adentro. Brilla hacia afuera.</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">Porque mereces sentirte hermosa en tu propia piel. Encuentra la magia del cuidado personal para consentirte, con opciones de compra al detal o al por mayor.</p>
        <a href="#solucion" class="btn-primary-magnetic">Inicia tu viaje aquí</a>
    </div>
</section>
<style>
  .modelo-hero { position: relative; height: 95vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .hero-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; animation: slowZoom 30s infinite alternate ease-in-out; }
  @keyframes slowZoom { 0% { transform: scale(1); } 100% { transform: scale(1.1); } }
  .hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(26,26,26,0.2), rgba(26,26,26,0.95)); }
  .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1000px; color: #F9F6F0; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  .hero-title { font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6.5rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .hero-desc { font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 3vw, 1.35rem); font-weight: 300; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 3rem; line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; }
  
  .btn-primary-magnetic {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
      background: var(--gold, #C5A059); color: var(--text-charcoal, #1A1A1A); text-decoration: none; font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 600; border-radius: 999px; transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.3s;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.3);
  }
  .btn-primary-magnetic:hover { transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.02); box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.5); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero-title { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 10vw, 3.5rem); }
  }
</style>
